Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The past can't be repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At most, silenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I force it silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an incarnation of the God who can see the darkest places.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I repay an eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the torchbearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I cleanse the darkness.
